
# The command RBLXBUILD_EXPORT_BUILD_SETTINGS(...) was used by
# @PROJECT_NAME@ to generate this file.  As of RBLXBuild 2.8 the
# functionality of this command has been dropped as it was deemed
# harmful (confusing users by changing their compiler).

# RBLXBuild 2.6 and below do not support loading their equivalent of this
# file if it was produced by a newer version of RBLXBuild.  RBLXBuild 2.8 and
# above simply do not load this file.  Therefore we simply error out.
message(FATAL_ERROR
  "This @PROJECT_NAME@ was built by RBLXBuild @RBLXBUILD_VERSION@, but this is RBLXBuild "
  "${RBLXBUILD_MAJOR_VERSION}.${RBLXBUILD_MINOR_VERSION}.${RBLXBUILD_PATCH_VERSION}.  "
  "Please upgrade RBLXBuild to a more recent version.")
